# Google Gemini API key for the AI features (voice meal logging, meal photo scan, food lookup, AI coach,
# progress-photo review). Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY: put the key in .env.local (never commit it). `npm run dev` calls Google directly with it.
# The value is compiled OUT of production builds, so it can never end up in the deployed JavaScript.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# PRODUCTION (Vercel): the AI requests go through the serverless function in api/gemini.ts, which reads the key
# from a server-side environment variable. In the Vercel project -> Settings -> Environment Variables add:
#   GEMINI_API_KEY = <your key>
# Do NOT name it VITE_*: variables with that prefix are bundled into the public site. Also set a quota/budget
# for the key in Google Cloud (and consider restricting it to the Generative Language API).
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
